<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= locals.title %></title>
</head>
<body>

  <%- include("partials/navigationTop") %>

  <main>

    <div>
      <h1>Game Companies</h1>
      <p>
        The gaming industry is home of thousands of
        talented developers and publishers who create the
        games we play and enjoy.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether you are looking for established industry leaders
        or smaller independent studios, you can explore their profiles,
        discover their games, and learn about their contributions to the
        gaming industry
      </p>
      <p>
        Some companies are focused on developing the games, from art to 
        the core logic. Others focus on publishing the game, which range from 
        financing to marketing and more. There are also companies that do both.
        These companies will be in both columns.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <form action="/companies" method="get">
        <button type="submit" name="filter" value="all">
          <span>All Companies:</span>
          &nbsp;
          <span><%= locals.counts.all %></span>
        </button>
        <button type="submit" name="filter" value="developers">
          <span>Developers:</span>
          &nbsp;
          <span><%= locals.counts.dev %></span>
        </button>
        <button type="submit" name="filter" value="publishers">
          <span>Publishers:</span>
          &nbsp;
          <span><%= locals.counts.pub %></span>
        </button>
        <button type="submit" name="filter" value="devpub">
          <span>Developer+Publisher:</span>
          &nbsp;
          <span><%= locals.counts.devpub %></span>
        </button>
      </form>
      <div>
        Companies
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  
</body>
</html>